msgstr ""
"Tick the confirmation that you are uploading the solution to the right "
"problem and that the file is legible."

#: apps/web/views/guardian.py:46
msgid "Wyrażam zgodę na udział mojego dziecka w Olimpiadzie Kwantowej."
msgstr "I consent to my child taking part in the Quantum Olympiad."

#: apps/web/views/guardian.py:47
msgid "Zaznacz pole zgody, żeby ją potwierdzić."
msgstr "Tick the consent box to confirm it."

